{{Unobtainable}}
'''Juvens''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] increases his health, switches attack to a [[Multi-Hit]] and grants a 20% chance to [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] attacks from [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies.

{{Cat Info
