}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Juvens CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Holiday Juvens CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Juvens is a dedicated anti-Angel tank. He's not a good generalist and his DPS is mostly limited by Single Attack, but his good base health combined with his Resistance can tank massive amounts of damage to Angels, being essentially a more expensive [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] with a longer recharge time. As a result, he performs well in Angel-dominant stages like [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]] or [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Parade of the Dead]].

==='''True Form'''===
With higher health and the Dodge Attack ability, Juvens gets an even stronger defense against Angel enemies. [[Multi-Hit]] somewhat relieves the fact that he has Single Target, and he has a fast attack rate so it will rarely hinder his performance. Angel enemies often rely rapid attacks to deal their damage, like [[Angelic Sleipnir]] or [[Angelic Gory]], which also gives him more opportunities to dodge, indirectly improving his lifespan.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Melee}}

